        96.66363525390625
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF for the diagnosis of extrapulmonary TB in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        107.71112060546875,
        207.19239807128906,
        121.338623046875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 3 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        131.46563720703125,
        513.2955322265625,
        146.7996368408203
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF may be used as a replacement test for usual practice (including",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        144.6656494140625,
        510.23760986328125,
        159.99964904785156
      ],
      "text": "conventional microscopy, culture, and/or histopathology) for testing of spe-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        157.86566162109375,
        513.2844848632812,
        173.1996612548828
      ],
      "text": "cific non-respiratory specimens (lymph nodes and other tissues) from children",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        171.065673828125,
        315.75732421875,
        186.39967346191406
      ],
      "text": "suspected of having extrapulmonary TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        196.58709716796875,
        395.3228454589844,
        209.9385986328125
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        221.32357788085938,
        513.41650390625,
        234.74407958984375
      ],
      "text": "Automated real-time nucleic acid amplification technology for rapid and  Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        235.12356567382812,
        510.2310485839844,
        248.5440673828125
      ],
      "text": "simultaneous detection of tuberculosis and rifampicin resistance: Xpert MTB/RIF sys-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        248.92355346679688,
        513.405029296875,
        262.34405517578125
      ],
      "text": "tem for the diagnosis of pulmonary and extrapulmonary TB in adults and children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        262.7235412597656,
        388.9519958496094,
        276.14404296875
      ],
      "text": "Policy Update.  Geneva, World Health Organization, 2013.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        287.322021484375,
        207.1944122314453,
        300.94952392578125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 4 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        311.06573486328125,
        513.2846069335938,
        326.39971923828125
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF should be used in preference to conventional microscopy and",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        324.2657470703125,
        513.2845458984375,
        339.5997314453125
      ],
      "text": "culture as the initial diagnostic test in testing cerebrospinal fluid specimens",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        337.46575927734375,
        358.5364074707031,
        352.79974365234375
      ],
      "text": "from children suspected of having TB meningitis",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        362.9872131347656,
        513.3935546875,
        376.3387145996094
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation given the urgency of rapid diagnosis, very low quality of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        376.7872009277344,
        148.889404296875,
        390.1387023925781
      ],
      "text": "evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        401.5237121582031,
        513.41650390625,
        414.9442138671875
      ],
      "text": "Automated real-time nucleic acid amplification technology for rapid and  Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        415.3236999511719,
        510.2310485839844,
        428.74420166015625
      ],
      "text": "simultaneous detection of tuberculosis and rifampicin resistance: Xpert MTB/RIF sys-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        429.1236877441406,
        513.405029296875,
        442.544189453125
      ],
      "text": "tem for the diagnosis of pulmonary and extrapulmonary TB in adults and children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        442.9236755371094,
        388.9519958496094,
        456.34417724609375
      ],
      "text": "Policy Update.  Geneva, World Health Organization, 2013.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        467.7981872558594,
        303.3343811035156,
        481.1496887207031
      ],
      "text": "Remarks for recommendations 3 and 4 :",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.18840789794922,
        492.60369873046875,
        510.2653503417969,
        505.9552001953125
      ],
      "text": "a. \t Children suspected of having extrapulmonary TB but with a single Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        506.4036865234375,
        513.4511108398438,
        519.7551879882812
      ],
      "text": "RIF-negative result should undergo further diagnostic testing, and those with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        520.2036743164062,
        513.4278564453125,
        533.55517578125
      ],
      "text": "high clinical suspicion for TB should be treated even if an Xpert MTB/RIF result is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        534.003662109375,
        304.4039001464844,
        547.3551635742188
      ],
      "text": "negative or if the test is not available.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.18840789794922,
        558.8091430664062,
        513.4166259765625,
        572.16064453125
      ],
      "text": "b. \t For CSF specimens, Xpert MTB/RIF should be preferentially used over culture if",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        572.6091918945312,
        513.3936157226562,
        585.960693359375
      ],
      "text": "the sample volume is low or additional specimens cannot be obtained, in order",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        586.4091796875,
        510.2193603515625,
        599.7606811523438
      ],
      "text": "to reach quick diagnosis. If sufficient volume of material is available, concentra-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        600.2091674804688,
        348.33392333984375,
        613.5606689453125
      ],
      "text": "tion methods should be used to increase yield.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.18840789794922,
        625.0146484375,
        513.3820190429688,
        638.3661499023438
      ],
      "text": "c. \t Pleural fluid is a suboptimal sample for the bacterial confirmation of pleural TB,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        638.8146362304688,
        513.4280395507812,
        652.1661376953125
      ],
      "text": "using any method. A pleural biopsy is the preferred sample. The sensitivity of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        652.6146850585938,
        510.1849670410156,
        665.9661865234375
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF in pleural fluid is very low. Nevertheless, any positive Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        666.4146728515625,
        513.405029296875,
        679.7661743164062
      ],
      "text": "RIF result based on pleural fluid should be treated for pleural TB, while those",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        680.2146606445312,
        469.08404541015625,
        693.566162109375
      ],
      "text": "with a negative Xpert MTB/RIF result should be followed by other tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.18840789794922,
        705.0202026367188,
        513.4625244140625,
        718.3717041015625
      ],
      "text": "d. \t These recommendations do not apply to stool, urine or blood, given the lack of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03640747070312,
        718.8201904296875,
        400.9119873046875,
        732.1716918945312
      ],
      "text": "data on the utility of Xpert MTB/RIF on theses specimens.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "24",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
